<title>SINGAPORE: ITE Electric 1996 net profit up 8 pct.</title>
<headline>ITE Electric 1996 net profit up 8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   1.14    vs     1.06</p>
<p>    Dividend  (pct)		    5.00    vs     5.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		  2.86    vs     2.65</p>
<p>    Turnover			    30.20    vs    28.86</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest    0.02    vs     0.04</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		 0.51    vs     0.49</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	   0.40    vs     0.26</p>
<p>    Income from associates	   0.06    vs     0.02</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     1.61    vs     1.49</p>
<p>    Tax				    0.56    vs     0.45</p>
<p>    Minorities			   0.04    vs     0.00</p>
<p>Dividend pay date: July 18, 1997</p>
<p>Last day books open: July 7, 1997</p>
<p>Note - ITE Electric Co Ltd is a distributor of electrical and control equipment.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 870 3088)</p>
</text>
